&lt;div class=&quot;presentation navmenudroite&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;separator&quot;&gt;Les arch&#233;types de guerrier&lt;a class=&quot;headeranchor&quot; id=&quot;Les_arch&#233;types_de_guerrier_0&quot; href=&quot;#Les_arch&#233;types_de_guerrier_0&quot; title=&quot;Link to this Section&quot; style=&quot;visibility: hidden;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;Retour &#224; la &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Guerrier.html&quot; title=&quot;Le guerrier&quot;&gt;classe&lt;/a&gt;.
